@startuml cu28
!theme plain
title CU28 — Ingresar nuevos folios

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : A notary (Escribano) decides to record the entry of new folios.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (First folio number; Last folio number; Register number; Year)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the indicated data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the new set of folios.
System -> System : System

@enduml